---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SMS Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms for the Sunset Hills First Ward temple recommend reminder text program."
>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p><em>Sunset Hills First Ward, Temple Recommend Reminder Program. Last updated August 2, 2026.</em></p>

    <h2>Program description</h2>
    <p>
      The Temple Recommend Reminder Program, operated by Keaton Wall on behalf of the Sunset Hills First
      Ward, sends text message (SMS) reminders to adult members when their temple recommend is
      approaching or has passed its expiration date, so they can schedule a renewal appointment.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      By giving your mobile number to ward leadership for this purpose, you consent to receive recurring
      reminder text messages from the program. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.
    </p>

    <h2>Message frequency</h2>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies. Recipients typically receive no more than a few messages per year, sent
      only as a temple recommend approaches or passes its expiration date.
    </p>

    <h2>Message and data rates</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Charges are set by your mobile carrier and your
      plan, and we have no control over them.
    </p>

    <h2>Opting out (STOP)</h2>
    <p>
      You can cancel at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message. After you reply STOP
      you will receive one confirmation and then no further messages unless you opt back in.
    </p>

    <h2>Getting help (HELP)</h2>
    <p>
      For help, reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message, or contact Keaton Wall at
      <a href="tel:+18018603443">801-860-3443</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Carrier liability</h2>
    <p>
      Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery depends on your mobile
      carrier and is not guaranteed.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Your information is handled as described in our <a href="/sms-privacy">SMS Privacy Policy</a>. We
      do not sell or share mobile numbers or SMS consent with third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Keaton Wall, Sunset Hills First Ward. <a href="tel:+18018603443">801-860-3443</a>.</p>

    <p>See also our <a href="/sms-privacy">SMS Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
